# WebDesk Growth Dashboard — project repository
# This repository is the DASHBOARD PROJECT (docs, ADRs, contracts, and — from Phase 1
# onward — the Turborepo application code). `webdesk-nodejs/` is a separately-versioned,
# shared Node.js delivery-system skill normally installed alongside this project, not
# part of its own history — committed here 2026-08-15 as a project-owner decision so this
# machine's copy is available for future reference/portability to another machine.

# Machine-specific local settings — must never be committed anywhere.
/webdesk-nodejs/.claude/settings.local.json

# Built export artifacts — regenerable from source, not source themselves.
*.zip
/webdesk-growth-dashboard-review-package-*/

# macOS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
__MACOSX/
*.swp

# Application dependencies and build output (Phase 1A onward)
node_modules/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.turbo/
dist/
dist-cjs/
build/
.next/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.pnpm-store/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
.vitest-cache/

# Never commit real secrets even if accidentally created under these names
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
prod-db.env
*.env
oauth-google-workspace.json
client_secret*.json
oauth*.json
